<item><title>Burundi allocates 10 billion francs to El Niño response plan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-allocates-10-billion-francs-to-el-nino-response-plan-35dbf6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-allocates-10-billion-francs-to-el-nino-response-plan-35dbf6/</guid><category>Burundi</category><description>The 2026-2027 plan is priced at 630.2 billion francs and targets climate risks including heavy rain, landslides and floods.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:21:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-allocates-10-billion-francs-to-el-nino-response-plan-35dbf6/share.jpg" length="39883" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bi/burundi-allocates-10-billion-francs-to-el-nino-response-plan-35dbf6/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
